WEBVTT

00:02:53.996 --> 00:03:00.636
(Music: "Adagio in G Minor" by Albinoni)

00:03:17.236 --> 00:03:20.076
(Music ends)

00:03:22.596 --> 00:03:25.916
OK, so the music is a little bit gloomy.

00:03:25.956 --> 00:03:27.676
It's full of longing, right?

00:03:27.716 --> 00:03:31.796
Maybe for a lost love
that never existed in the first place,